# Mac App Store apps.
#
# Separate from homebrew/Brewfile so that `brew bundle dump` on the main file
# cannot clobber this list, and so games stay out of a machine setup.
#
# Requires the `mas` CLI (declared in homebrew/Brewfile) and an Apple Account
# that already "owns" each app — `mas install` cannot make a first purchase.
#
# Install:  brew bundle --file=homebrew/Brewfile.mas
# Check:    brew bundle check --file=homebrew/Brewfile.mas

# Development
